      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "work-template-design"
        },
        "markdown": "## 1. Identity and Hero\n\nThe opening surface answers **what is this?** before asking the visitor to read.\n\n- Title\n- Short tagline\n- Cover image, SVG, animation, or video\n- Status: concept, active, complete, archived\n- Work type and primary audience\n- Author and updated date\n\nThis is the poster outside the exhibit.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1784508920038,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
