      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "work-template-design"
        },
        "markdown": "## 2. Summary and Context\n\nA compact explanation of the work:\n\n- What is it?\n- Why does it exist?\n- What problem, question, or desire produced it?\n- Why might someone care?\n- What should a visitor understand before entering?\n\nPrefer one strong summary over a wall of biography.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1784508920038,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
