      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "work-template-design"
        },
        "markdown": "## 3. Primary Experience\n\nEvery work should expose one obvious thing to do.\n\nExamples:\n\n- Explore the graph\n- Read the document\n- Watch the demonstration\n- Run the experience\n- Inspect the source\n\nThis should be a real navigable or consumable surface, not a decorative card pretending to be a doorway.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1784508920038,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
