      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "work-template-design"
        },
        "markdown": "## 4. Gallery and Evidence\n\nShow the work before explaining every bolt.\n\nPossible material:\n\n- Screenshots\n- Video clips\n- Interactive previews\n- Diagrams\n- Before-and-after states\n- Representative outputs\n\nThe gallery is optional, but visual works should not arrive wearing a paper bag.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1784508920038,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
