      ],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "work-template-design"
        },
        "markdown": "## 6. Facts and Technical Details\n\nStructured details that reward inspection:\n\n- Artifact type\n- Technology and tools\n- Repository or source location\n- License\n- Difficulty or maturity\n- Dependencies\n- Supported platforms\n- Known limitations\n\nKeep these scannable. The work should not require archaeology to answer basic questions.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1784508920038,
