      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "work-template-design"
        },
        "markdown": "## 7. Connections and Resources\n\nA work should reveal its neighborhood.\n\n- Related works\n- Parent collection\n- Tutorials or documentation\n- Source repository\n- External website\n- People, organizations, or events involved\n\nThis is where Twilite can surpass the lonely README: the work belongs to a living web.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1784508920038,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "work-template-open-questions",
      "type": "markdown",
      "label": "Questions for Codex",
      "root": false,
      "position": {
        "x": 1420,
        "y": 350
      },
      "width": 520,
